I have to say that I agree with Carl here and don't see what the
big deal with ESP is, at all. I just don't find it that helpful.
And if I do want it, I can always wish for a helm of telepathy,
and still have the insurance that lifesaving provides.

> My experience with AoLS is that if I need it once, I'll need it
